# The Deep Principle

At a deeper level, computer vision is about **inference**.

The computer observes:

```text
Pixels
```

and tries to infer:

```text
Objects
Relationships
Actions
Meaning
```

The process is:

```text
Observation
     |
     v
Pattern Recognition
     |
     v
Knowledge Extraction
     |
     v
Decision Making
```

